This directory contains a verbatim copy of the JSON-RPC 2.0 implementation from
the Model Context Protocol Go SDK, version v1.6.1:

    github.com/modelcontextprotocol/go-sdk@v1.6.1/internal/jsonrpc2
    github.com/modelcontextprotocol/go-sdk@v1.6.1/internal/json (-> ./internaljson)

It is copied here solely to enable an apples-to-apples performance comparison in
the benchmark harness. The original package lives under an internal/ path and is
therefore not importable, so vendoring the source is the only way to benchmark it
faithfully. The only modification is rewriting the internal/json import path to the
local ./internaljson copy. The original MIT-style license headers are preserved on
each file; see the upstream LICENSE at github.com/modelcontextprotocol/go-sdk.
